          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ethiopic script font designed in a handwritten style.\n\nThe Geʾez Handwriting Dots Arrows regular typeface applies directional arrows to the \"Geʾez Handwriting Dots\" style to indicate stroke direction.\n\nThis font is part of a collection of 14 typefaces developed to help teach handwriting to children.\n\nProject Homepage: https://github.com/raeytype/geez-handwriting-fonts\n"
